OL,3,ABali jails Swiss tourist for insulting
OL,4,Asacred Day of Silence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Swiss tourist has been sentenced to
OL,7,Fone year in prison for insulting a
OL,8,Fsacred religious event on Indonesia's
OL,9,Fholiday island of Bali.
OL,11,FIn a now-removed video, Luzian Andrin
OL,12,FZgraggen, 26, had filmed himself
OL,13,Fwalking to an empty beach during the
OL,14,FHindu holiday of Nyepi, describing the
OL,15,Fscene as "crazy".
OL,17,FHe was arrested in March after the
OL,18,Fvideo sparked widespread anger among
OL,19,FBalinese on social media.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
